# Surface identity, independent of albedo brightness. Values are normalized.
# profile name specular smoothness metallic normal_detail normal_relief slope_limit grime_roughness variation exposed_metal anisotropy frost repeat
# Paint, concrete, rubber and ice remain dielectric. Rust/grime reduce exposed metal.
profile concrete .36 .20 0 .65 1.35 .48 .18 .045 0 0 0 1
profile painted_concrete .38 .31 0 .45 1.15 .40 .20 .045 0 0 0 1
profile sealed_concrete .38 .34 0 .40 1.10 .40 .20 .040 0 0 0 1
profile rough_concrete .34 .13 0 .80 1.65 .55 .20 .055 0 0 0 1
profile painted_steel .40 .55 .025 .20 1.10 .38 .23 .045 .28 .04 0 1
profile worn_steel .42 .61 .72 .22 1.40 .48 .22 .055 .10 .22 0 1
profile cast_iron .38 .39 .62 .48 1.25 .55 .22 .060 .08 .06 0 1
profile brushed_steel .42 .72 .82 .12 .80 .32 .18 .035 .06 .40 0 1
profile tread_steel .40 .56 .74 .25 1.70 .65 .23 .055 .10 .18 0 1
profile grate_steel .40 .50 .72 .18 2.10 .72 .24 .055 .10 .12 0 1
profile machine .40 .57 .36 .18 1.35 .45 .25 .055 .24 .15 0 0
profile rubber .36 .27 0 .30 .65 .32 .13 .040 0 0 0 1
profile frosted_concrete .40 .35 0 .32 1.35 .44 .18 .060 0 0 .85 1
profile cryo_enamel .42 .66 .025 .12 .90 .34 .18 .040 .18 .03 .65 1
profile frosted_steel .42 .64 .56 .18 1.15 .40 .20 .050 .08 .18 .70 1
profile console .40 .58 .02 .06 .35 .18 .18 .025 .18 .03 0 0
profile screen .44 .84 0 0 0 0 .025 .010 0 0 0 0
profile paper .28 .18 0 .03 .03 .04 .035 .010 0 0 0 0
profile gunmetal .40 .62 .38 .15 .80 .30 .22 .035 .20 .18 0 0
profile ceiling_beams .42 .54 .48 .12 1.10 .36 .23 .040 .10 .16 0 1

# Cryo labs: smooth dielectric finishes, shallow wear, and restrained local frost.
# Flecked laminate stays almost flat; grout and gasket seams retain gentle relief.
profile cryo_ceramic .42 .74 0 .06 1.05 .28 .18 .025 0 0 0 1
profile cryo_laminate .40 .69 0 .025 .30 .12 .18 .025 0 0 0 1
profile cryo_wall_enamel .42 .73 .015 .05 .80 .25 .20 .025 .12 .03 .12 1
profile cryo_ceiling_enamel .40 .64 .015 .04 .65 .24 .20 .025 .10 .03 0 1
profile cryo_frosted_cladding .42 .61 .015 .10 .90 .30 .20 .030 .10 .03 .48 1

# Dedicated prop finishes: shallow relief avoids embossing printed grime.
profile prop_case_paint .40 .60 .025 .10 .65 .30 .22 .035 .26 .04 0 1
profile prop_aged_paint .40 .48 .025 .14 .80 .34 .26 .045 .24 .03 0 1
profile prop_lab_enamel .42 .73 .015 .06 .45 .24 .20 .025 .14 .02 .18 1
profile prop_cast_housing .40 .42 .62 .25 .85 .38 .28 .045 .10 .10 0 1
profile prop_cable_rubber .36 .24 .015 .10 .55 .28 .16 .030 .02 .03 0 1
profile prop_worktop_rubber .36 .29 0 .08 .42 .23 .15 .025 0 .08 0 1
profile prop_clean_fittings .42 .78 .84 .06 .35 .23 .16 .025 .04 .45 0 1

